  "prompt": "Is a ₱14,000 monthly residential unit rental subject to VAT?",
  "answer": "### Issue Presented\nIs a ₱14,000 monthly residential unit rental subject to VAT?\n\n### Short Answer\nNo, a ₱14,000 monthly residential unit rental is not subject to VAT.\n\n### Legal Interpretation\n\n### Practical Application\nIn practice, landlords charging a monthly rental of ₱14,000 for residential units are not required to impose VAT on the rental payments. This exemption allows landlords to offer more competitive rental rates without the added tax burden, benefiting tenants as well. It is essential for landlords to ensure that their rental agreements reflect this exemption to avoid any potential tax liabilities.",
